Good to see you!

26
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:47,080
Tanjiro, you're back!

27
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,440
Well, it's about time.

28
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:50,900
It's been a while. It's good to see you.

29
