279
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,220
And get stronger!

280
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:07,940
And get stronger!

281
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:10,160
Look at that.

282
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,160
Hm.

283
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:29,520
