290
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:57,840
Counting on you.

291
00:19:58,980 --> 00:19:59,580
Right.

292
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,420
I will defeat him.

293
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:01,600
Hm.

294
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:03,740
Hm.

295
00:20:03,740 --> 00:20:09,360
