333
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:27,500
You really love them equally, don't you?

334
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:31,540
I love those three more than anything else in the world, Kamado.

335
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:33,380
More Tengen!

336
00:23:34,460 --> 00:23:36,060
They're incredible, aren't they?

337
00:23:36,740 --> 00:23:39,060
Episode 4 to bring a smile to one's face.

